# CasperOS — apt pinning for trixie-backports.
#
# Priority 100 = "only if explicitly asked for" (or already installed). Without
# this, adding the backports suite would let apt pull newer libc, systemd and
# i915-era userspace into a stable image on the next `apt upgrade`.
#
# The Hyprland / Quickshell stack is installed with an explicit
# `-t trixie-backports`, which overrides this pin for exactly those packages.
Package: *
Pin: release n=trixie-backports
Pin-Priority: 100
